### Salesforce Nexus AI Server — Execute Pipeline API tests
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client and JetBrains HTTP Client
###
### Setup:
### 1. Set the variables below (or use environment variables / .env)
### 2. Create an API client in the admin UI: Administration → API clients
###    (secret is shown only once — copy it)
### 3. Find your project name/id and pipeline_id from the UI or API
### 4. Send the requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@project = default
@pipelineId = YOUR_PIPELINE_ID_HERE

# Consumer key auth (recommended for non-interactive calls)
@consumerKey = YOUR_CONSUMER_KEY
@consumerSecret = YOUR_CONSUMER_SECRET

# Optional: login credentials for JWT auth
@username = admin
@password = admin123

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Login (get JWT token) — optional if using consumer key
### -------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Execute pipeline — Consumer Key + Secret
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute/{{project}}/pipeline/{{pipelineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Consumer-Key: {{consumerKey}}
X-Consumer-Secret: {{consumerSecret}}

{
  "payload": {
    "User_Message__c": "show me the latest modification for Project 4130650"
  },
  "org_id": null
}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Execute pipeline — Bearer token (from login above)
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute/{{project}}/pipeline/{{pipelineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "payload": {
    "User_Message__c": "What is the status of project 4130650?"
  }
}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Direct DSS execute (JWT only)
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute/dss-client
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "payload": {
    "User_Message__c": "Hello from HTTP client"
  }
}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Direct Langflow execute (JWT only)
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/execute/langflow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "payload": {
    "User_Message__c": "Hello from HTTP client"
  }
}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 6. List API clients (admin JWT required)
### -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/api-clients
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Create an API client (admin JWT required)
###    The secret is returned only once — save it immediately
### -------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/api-clients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "name": "Test Client from HTTP",
  "project_id": null,
  "enabled": true
}
